  "gaps": [
    "The tooltip API has no locations for fishing pools, so pools have no zones or maps. The Wowhead object pages may list them, but could not be read from this environment. warcraft.wiki.gg describes the Classic zones of some pools in text (for example Oily Blackmouth Schools off Arathi Highlands, Desolace and Dustwallow Marsh), but that is Classic, not Forever.",
    "Which fish each zone gives, and the fishing skill each zone needs, are not collected. Neither is on the tooltip API.",
    "Pool contents are listed only where the pool is named after its catch. Floating Wreckage, Floating Debris, Oil Spill, School of Fish, School of Tastyfish and Muddy Churning Waters are not known yet.",
    "No new Forever fishing pool was found in object IDs 600000-720000. Only one new raw fish was found (Whimsyfin); items 248000-290500 were read in full.",
    "Max skill and rank requirements are the Classic values: the Fishing spell tooltips do not state them.",
    "Fishing trainers, training costs and the Expert and Artisan rank sources are not covered."
  ],
  "fetched": "2026-11-27"
}
